      "translationZh": "Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform 上的 Grok 4.6",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4af9a7518c85454f",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.6 现已可通过 Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform 使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49753095737d2276",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们很高兴地宣布，Grok 4.6 现已在 Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform 上推出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2fbaeeb125bfe5e0",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.6 是我们最新的旗舰模型，专为长时间运行的智能体以及雄心勃勃的交互式和视觉工作而打造。它提供 500k 的上下文窗口和可配置的推理力度（low、medium、high、xhigh）。现在，Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform 用户可以通过 Model Garden 使用该模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4be61b9f65580f3c",
      "translationZh": "能力与定价",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "81b64985918bd7ca",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.6 的定价如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "aa1a3ab85e0888cc",
      "translationZh": "输入：每 1 million tokens 为 2",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "393fe7658420c101",
      "translationZh": "缓存输入：每 100 万 tokens 0.50",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bf720ad4e17cafcb",
      "translationZh": "输出：每 100 万 tokens 6",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "13d9afcf3574fec4",
      "translationZh": "如需了解该模型的更多信息，请阅读 Grok 4.6 发布公告。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f7f484f389cb7d22",
      "translationZh": "在 Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform 上使用 Grok 4.6 构建应用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "081472c05a122aaa",
      "translationZh": "开发者现在可以在 Model Garden 中使用 Grok 4.6。要开始使用，请访问 Grok 4.6 模型卡。我们期待看到你构建的应用！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
